{
  "bookId": "hero-214016",
  "id": "bond-26046",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26046001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你还好吗，脸色很差。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "完全卡住了......女主角告白的台词，我写不出来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "可恶，根本没有能参考的恋爱经历！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我还以为，玉夏写过那么多同人文，对这种桥段信手拈来呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "话是这么说，但这次不一样......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不一样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "唯独这次，是代入自己......作为女主角的小说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "完全从实际出发，反而不知道该怎么落笔了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我能帮上什么忙吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "刚才也说了，是女主角向心仪的人告白，对吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "呐，让我对你告白试试看？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "难道心仪的人代入的是我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "笨、笨蛋！居然直接问出口......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26046014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玉夏",
          "text": "可是这样不就......没有必要再告白了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
